        "body": "CPU Usage: Shows current processor load. If usage stays high, review video decoding, AI analysis, concurrent access, recording tasks, and background services. Memory Usage (RAM): Shows memory and cache pressure. Investigate persistent growth, unusual allocation, or cache that is not released by reviewing service behavior over time. Disk Usage: Shows space consumed by recordings, logs, exports, and cache. Limited free space can affect recording writes, exports, and logging. Review retention and capacity before storage is exhausted. Operational Assessment: Compare resource use with camera counts, AI tasks, recording schedules, and system logs. Use the indicators to guide investigation, then verify the cause in the affected workflow."
