        "body": "Create and Rename Tabs: Create a tab for an area or task, choose a layout, and add cameras. Short names such as Lobby, Parking, or Night Patrol make views easier to identify. Independent Saved Views: Each tab retains its camera selection, grid layout, and arrangement. Select the tab to load that view for inspection or event verification. Deletion and the Default Tab: Delete a tab only when its camera selection and layout are no longer needed. At least one default tab remains; you cannot delete the last tab. Keeping Tabs Usable: Group tabs by area, recurring task, or temporary incident. Remove duplicate and unused tabs, and keep names short. Navigation, scrolling, and collapse behavior depend on the interface."
