        "heading": "Page Interactions",
        "body": "Depending on the deployment, opening the list may mark visible records as read, stop the camera’s flashing indicator, or silence the current sound. Configuration also determines whether a later alarm sounds again. Reading a notification or stopping an alert does not confirm or close the event.Open a notification to review its associated clip. After saving a classification, status, or note, verify the list and details. Active filters and state rules determine whether a completed event remains in the pending view."
