        "id": "troubleshooting-method",
        "heading": "Troubleshooting Approach",
        "body": "Establish whether the issue affects one account, one camera, one interval, or the platform as a whole. Record the time and visible error. Start with the configuration closest to the failure, change one relevant setting at a time, and retain the retest result."
